  "prefLabel": "Man 211.04 Appeal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Man 211.04 Appeal. Any person aggrieved by the board's decision to deny a rehearing or by the board's decision after rehearing may appeal to the Superior Court in accordance with RSA 205-A:28, II and the procedures set forth in RSA 677:2 through RSA 677:14.\n\nSource. #8286-A, eff 2-16-05",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/man100-400.html"
